 "_comment": [
  "Steep (steep.exe, Ubisoft Connect version, as of 2026-10-26).",
  "position: pointer chains from static addresses to the player's transform (tools/trainer/ptrscan.py):",
  "[[module+root] + o1] + o2 ... = the struct; the position float3 is at struct + offset. Found in one",
  "session and not yet confirmed across launches/maps: the overlay takes the address most chains agree on.",
