  "fixes: crash guards (native/overlay/fixes.cpp): a NULL in null_guard at rva is pointed at a zeroed block.",
  "camera: pointer chains to the third-person camera's position (tools/trainer/findcam.py: points orbiting the player while the camera turns; ptrscan depth 4); the overlay's Fly moves along camera -> player."
